1333
01:56:02,833 --> 01:56:04,333
Tidak akan kelihatan asli, Bu.

1334
01:56:07,958 --> 01:56:08,791
Tidak apa-apa.

1335
01:56:10,000 --> 01:56:11,166
Lakukan sebisamu.

1336
01:56:44,958 --> 01:56:45,625
Earng.

1337
01:56:45,750 --> 01:56:47,041
Aku membawakan kipas angin untukmu.

1338
01:56:48,333 --> 01:56:49,541
Terima kasih, Jane.

1339
01:56:53,166 --> 01:56:54,000
Bibi Oom?

1340
01:56:55,250 --> 01:56:56,291
Aku juga tidak tahu.

1341
01:56:56,416 --> 01:56:58,291
Dia mungkin ada di rumah Bibi Daeng.

1342
01:57:03,916 --> 01:57:05,166
Ini, untukmu.

1343
01:57:06,875 --> 01:57:08,541
Hei, tidak perlu, Jane.

1344
01:57:09,208 --> 01:57:12,416
Aku jarang main akhir-akhir ini.

1345
01:57:13,750 --> 01:57:14,791
Aku ingin memberikannya kepadamu.

1346
01:57:15,041 --> 01:57:15,875
Terimalah.

1347
01:57:17,833 --> 01:57:19,833
Lagi pula, aku jarang memakai yang ini.

1348
01:57:20,958 --> 01:57:22,000
Baiklah.

1349
01:57:25,583 --> 01:57:26,916
Keluarlah dan bermainlah hari ini, ya?

1350
01:57:27,666 --> 01:57:28,750
Sebagai ucapan selamat terakhir untukku.

1351
01:57:31,166 --> 01:57:32,875
Kurasa aku tidak bisa, Jane.

1352
01:57:33,416 --> 01:57:35,541
Aku harus menyetrika
dan mengantarkannya hari ini.

1353
01:57:43,916 --> 01:57:45,250
Boleh aku minta itu?

1354
01:57:51,416 --> 01:57:52,291
Ini?

1355
01:58:08,583 --> 01:58:09,666
LAPANGAN KOTORAN ANJING

1356
01:58:09,750 --> 01:58:11,083
Jika mereka hendak mengecat ulang

1357
01:58:11,166 --> 01:58:12,833
