1358
01:58:14,041 --> 01:58:15,166
Sepertinya itu tidak mungkin.

1359
01:58:15,250 --> 01:58:16,291
Foto saja?

1360
01:58:17,166 --> 01:58:18,083
Ya.

1361
01:58:22,958 --> 01:58:24,125
Hei, tunggu.

1362
01:58:38,875 --> 01:58:39,791
Cepat.

1363
01:58:42,666 --> 01:58:44,083
-Giliranku.
-Ya.

1364
01:59:17,541 --> 01:59:24,083
JANE, NICE, INK, AMY, EARNG, TONG, ANN

1365
01:59:34,458 --> 01:59:36,083
Tong, ayo.

1366
01:59:37,125 --> 01:59:40,291
Sekarang giliranmu buat berjaga,
dan aku yang pegang taruhannya, ya?

1367
02:00:18,208 --> 02:00:21,541
<i>Nomor yang anda tuju sedang tidak aktif.</i>

1368
02:00:22,708 --> 02:00:25,583
<i>Silakan tinggalkan pesan</i>
<i>setelah nada berikut ini.</i>

1369
02:00:33,208 --> 02:00:34,416
Halo, Ann.

1370
02:00:35,458 --> 02:00:36,291
Ini Jane.

1371
02:00:39,625 --> 02:00:40,416
Aku tidak tahu…

1372
02:00:41,666 --> 02:00:43,166
