1373
02:00:44,750 --> 02:00:47,250
Tapi aku tetap ingin memberitahumu.

1374
02:00:50,791 --> 02:00:51,666
Besok...

1375
02:00:53,250 --> 02:00:54,916
aku akan pindah dari flat.

1376
02:00:58,666 --> 02:01:00,333
Orang tuaku bercerai.

1377
02:01:03,000 --> 02:01:04,833
Tanpa keberadaanmu di sini...

1378
02:01:06,833 --> 02:01:08,166
